    "description": "<p><strong>Mark a Stress</strong> to make an attack against a target within Far range. On a success, deal <strong>4d10+14</strong> magic damage and roll a <strong>[[/r d6]]</strong>. On a result of 4 or higher, the lightning bounces, and the Titan makes this attack against a different target within Very Close range of the previous target. Each time the lightning bounces, decrease the damage it deals by <strong>[[/r 1d10]]</strong>.</p>",
